      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 7 years 9 months ago",
      "body": "Hi,\nAfter giving birth to our son Lucas on the 21st I’ve been breastfeeding successfully for nearly a week now.\nI want to take the Pregnacare breastfeeding supplements but I’m also giving Lucas the prescribed Neokay Vitamin K oral drops.\nThe pregnacare tablets contain vitamin k so I’m just concerned that he may then take on too much from my milk and the oral drops? Does anyone have any idea on this?\nThank you!\nErin",
